WEBVTT

00:00:28.002 --> 00:00:31.345
"Lakrimal gland" rondika çê dike

00:00:31.062 --> 00:00:36.353
"Lacrimal punktum" qanala rondika ya.

00:00:36.911 --> 00:00:38.949
Û ewqas digirî

00:00:38.949 --> 00:00:41.257
rojê 283 gr,

00:00:41.257 --> 00:00:43.469
salê 113 lître!

00:00:43.098 --> 00:00:48.101
Ji nêzîk binêrin xuyaye
hertim hinekî digirî.

00:00:49.293 --> 00:00:52.525
İris bê rawest rondikê bazal çêdike,

00:00:52.592 --> 00:00:54.999
ev bi 3 tebeqe pêk tê,

00:00:54.999 --> 00:00:58.383
û qirêjê dûr dike.

00:00:58.383 --> 00:01:01.200
Nik îrîsê tebeqeya muqusê heye,